bubble_sort.py<pre><code>def bubble_sort(items):
for i in range(len(items)):
for j in range(len(items) - 1 - i):
if items[j] &gt; items[j + 1]:
items[j], items[j + 1] = items[j + 1], items[j] # (1)!
</code></pre> <ol> <li>Annotate should be in comment section! # for bash and yaml and // for java</li> </ol>

